    <h2>Path</h2>
    <p>
      I spent 13 years running technology and day-to-day operations for a school in Taiwan —
      network uptime, documentation discipline, and a full remote-learning deployment during
      COVID with zero outside IT support, for 150+ students and 8 staff across 12 classrooms.
      Before that, I worked as a case manager on HIPAA-regulated patient records, so
      compliance obligations aren't theoretical to me — I've been the person accountable for
      them.
    </p>
    <p>
